# The Iron Whale - Bow (CIPlay iron_whale_bow): the ramp, the roster, the water plant, the captain's log, the mess safe (keypad
# 4127), the galley, the cut aerial lead, the zipline to the crane, the crane box, the cargo office (uncovers the hatch), the hatch.
island The Iron Whale - Bow
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Boarding the Whale
expect hidden hatchzone
zone ramp
expect step 1
read Iron Whale: crew roster
expect step 2
open Water plant
wait 3
expect step 3
read Captain's log, day 1
expect step 4
open Mess safe
expect message locked
code messpad 4127
expect story messcode 1
open Mess safe
wait 3
expect step 5
open Galley locker
wait 3
expect step 6
read Post for H. Brask
read The cook's complaint
zone foredeck
read Aerial lead, cut
expect step 7
zone crane
expect step 8
open Crane box
wait 3
expect step 9
open Cargo office
wait 3
# DEEP 10-24: the hatch is iced over - the Crane Ridge, the cab, the hook's lever
expect hidden hatchzone
expect shown hatchice
expect step 10
zone crane_foot
expect step 11
zone crane_cab
expect step 12
open Crane cab locker
read Crane driver's last shift
use cranelever
expect story hookdrop 1
expect hidden hatchice
expect shown hatchzone
expect step 13
use cranelever
expect message hook is down
zone hatch
expect done
# the extras: the whalers' cave and ruin, the sunk lifeboat, two treasures
read Ice survey, sheet 4
zone whalers_cave
read Whalers' tally
open Whalers' pots
read Whalers' winter list
open Whalers' chest
zone lifeboat_hole
air lifeair
open Lifeboat locker
dig 0
dig 1
